  "content": "<h2>創造更多座位</h2><p>也請看看我的其他模組：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-trainutilities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Train Utilities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-train-lights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Train Lights</a></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3b54ad5c623f7d9152857979f2b729e46bf43037_0.webp\" alt=\"標題\"></p><p>此模組為列車和機械裝置新增了兩種現代座位。</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DkcprwueFj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discord.com/api/guilds/1248636479627071488/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><h2>依賴項目</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> / <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Fabric</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></li>\n</ul><h2>特性</h2><h3>座位展示</h3><div style=\"display:flex\"><img width=\"49.5%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cec1b695a56c8ae174b68c82aff1ebda727d2de2.png\" alt=\"圖片一\"> <img style=\"margin-left:20px\" width=\"49.5%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e06f8c60af5519be8dd65913c929ae865858459b.png\" alt=\"圖片二\"></div><h3>所有變種</h3><div style=\"display:flex\"><img width=\"49.5%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/73ec3efae79847b5485f99d860f7e114a8de746d.png\" alt=\"圖片一\"> <img style=\"margin-left:20px\" width=\"49.5%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/46b17ae41b62bd030493ea26dd8349e3049e1434.png\" alt=\"圖片二\"></div><h3>更多功能</h3><ul>\n<li>可用於列車</li>\n<li>可染色</li>\n</ul><h2>支援語言</h2><ul>\n<li>英文</li>\n</ul><h2>重要提醒！</h2><p>在安裝模組更新前，請務必備份您的世界，以避免資料損毀。</p><h2>支持我</h2><p>如果您想支持我和我的作品，請參考我的 Ko-fi 頁面 ❤️</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fadeptstack_programmerlp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a></li>\n</ul><h2>致謝</h2><p>感謝 Vinicius M 提供精美的視覺作品 :)</p>",
